                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our seniors deserve access to the best quality of care available, which is why I'm proud to introduce the Ensuring Patient Access to Critical Breakthrough Products Act. #utpol (1/3)\n\nhttps://t.co/QWWxoFVyL4",
