                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I introduced the Advancing Health Saving Act to help patients access the benefits of their health savings accounts as soon as they are covered under an HSA-eligible high deductible health plan, lower their cost of care, & empower patients to take charge of their health care.",
