                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This bill is a commonsense reform measure that will give patients peace of mind in knowing they have access to the savings afforded by HSAs for certain medical expenses incurred before they could establish their HSA.",
