                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Recently, the Biden Administration proposed a new rule limiting the scope of the minerals that are eligible for coverage and expedited permitting under Title 41 of the Fixing America\u2019s Surface Transportation Act (FAST-41). Limiting the scope to critical minerals will harm America\u2019s ability to quickly and effectively produce minerals like copper, iron, and host minerals from which we derive critical minerals. #utpol",
